<title>USA: Unity Bancorp says names Carlson as CFO.</title>
<headline>Unity Bancorp says names Carlson as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CLINTON, N.J. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unity Bancorp Inc said Tuesday its board had appointed Controller Julie Carlson as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Carlson, who joined the company in 1992, also serves as a vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>Unity Bancorp's subsidiary, First Community Bank, is a full-service commercial bank.</p>
